/F1 16 Tf (Northstar Desk security overview) Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf (This overview describes how Northstar Desk protects customer data. It is written for) Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf (security reviewers and applies to every plan.) Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf (Encryption. Customer data is encrypted at rest with AES-256. All traffic to) Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf (Northstar Desk uses TLS 1.2 or higher. Plain HTTP connections are redirected or) Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf (refused.) Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf (Backups. Each region is backed up daily. Backups are encrypted, kept for 35 days,) Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf (and stored in a second availability zone inside the same region. Our recovery point) Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf (objective is 24 hours and our recovery time objective is 8 hours.) Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf (Testing. An independent firm runs a penetration test of the product once a year.) Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf (Findings rated high or critical are fixed within 30 days.) Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf (Compliance reports. Northstar Desk holds a SOC 2 Type II report. Team and Enterprise) Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf (customers can request it under a non-disclosure agreement from the Compliance) Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf (section of the security settings.) Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf (Staff access. Northstar employees can open a customer workspace only after an Admin) Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf (of that workspace grants support access. A support access grant expires) Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf (automatically after 72 hours, and every access is recorded.) Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf (Reporting a vulnerability. Send security reports to security@northstardesk.example.) Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf (We acknowledge every report within 3 business days and keep the reporter informed) Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf (until the issue is fixed.) Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf () Tj T*
